  "details": "https://hello.vrchat.com/community-guidelines\n\n`Do not use VRChat systems in a way intended to mislead, trick, fool, or confuse people.`\n\nCommunity Guidelines 5.6. already has a clause to prohibit the sort of false or misleading world thumbnails, whether it is made by AI, or otherwise Photoshopped in a misleading manner.\n\nThe problem is not specific to AI.\n\nThe problem is **VRChat is not enforcing its own rules**.\n\nSolution:\n\n1. VRChat should start enforcing its guidelines and clamp down on misleading AI world thumbnails.\n\n2. VRChat should actively monitor world thumbnails, and visit/check worlds with suspiciously good looking thumbnails.\n\n3. What you can do: Report any misleading thumbnails you see. Help VRChat do their job.",
